WEBVTT

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.110
The monsters from beyond the 
moon are quite cruel, it seems.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:17.960
The Seraphim sent you?

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.390
Have you come to kill me?

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.140
No, you are a puppet that 
can easily be replaced.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.960
If I killed you, the monsters from beyond the moon

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.540
would simply create a new observer.

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:35.180
What are you going to do to me then?

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.240
Nothing.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.610
I intended to find a way 
to make use of you...

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:42.610
But I decided against it.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.270
Why?

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.910
If life is so painful for you,

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:50.020
you must be plotting revenge.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.630
Against the scum who created you.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.790
Against the gods beyond the moon.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.850
In that case, I don't need to interfere.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.290
Hey, Bro! I'm done with my bath!

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:54.170
"(Extracurricular) Activities While Passing Each Other By"

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:48.810
I'll take mine later.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.980
Oh, you must be reading something naughty.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:55.410
I'm not! Look.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:58.010
Introduction to Black Magic

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.990
Introduction to Black Magic...?

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:00.950
There's naughty stuff in here?

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:04.980
You've got it wrong! I 
just borrowed this...

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:08.910
Er... I took it without telling Gekkou.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.630
Huh? Gekkou...?

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:12.300
You mean Kurenai Gekkou-sama?!

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.830
He's so famous that everybody 
at our school knows him!

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.150
Famous, huh...

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:21.780
I guess that he's pretty incredible 
if you ignore how he's a jerk.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.890
Okay! I'll swallow my pride!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:27.810
B-Bro?

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:33.880
The fast track to becoming 
strong is by asking for advice.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.560
Hey, check it out.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.450
Yeah.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.190
Haruka's serious...

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:44.050
This is what happens when a childhood 
friend goes for the jugular.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:49.880
Taito isn't here yet.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:54.920
The military is impressive.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:59.130
They restored the entire 
place in one day.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:03.170
It's all those miserable 
wretches are good for.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:07.330
And? Did you come here to inform 
me of your worthless opinion?

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.030
O-Oh... It's about this...

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:12.980
Sorry about taking it without 
asking for permission.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:14.900
Oh?

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:19.030
I haven't touched this book in 
a while. Not since grade school.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:22.180
W-Wait a moment! Grade school?!

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:22.990
And?

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:26.680
What does a scumbag who 
couldn't understand a primer

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.570
that a monkey could 
easily comprehend need?

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.370
Suck it up!

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:35.900
Well, I have a proposition.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.160
A proposition?

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.750
What language should I 
 use to communicate

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.890
with someone with a weaker 
mind than a monkey?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.200
Stupidese?

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:46.270
Unfortunately, I never 
learned Stupidese.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:50.010
Are stupid, scum, and monkey 
the only words you know?!

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.940
Besides, do you even 
understand this book?!

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:55.160
Show me proof! Prove it!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.700
Very well.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.270
Tai—

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:04.070
Hot!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:05.510
Water!

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:08.500
Ooh, immortal guy's on fire.

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.350
Did you do that?

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.820
I told you that I wouldn't 
let you abuse Taito.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:16.540
Do I need to use force 
to make that clear?

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:20.090
You're always so overprotective.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:26.570
The idiot appears to be 
thinking things through.

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:35.050
That bastard... I'm gonna 
kill him one of these days.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:41.860
Geh.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:47.880
Ah, uh... You're from class 5...

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.530
Aomi, was it?

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.570
I thought I could smell 
something burning...

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.450
What were you doing?

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:59.150
I-I was just using the facilities...

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.630
In the girls' restroom?

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.300
Uh-oh...

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.470
Now, then.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.830
What were you doing in here?

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.320
If you're up to something 
fun, count me in.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.640
I'm not doing anything fun.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.810
And I'm leaving now.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.840
You can play dumb, but 
I've done my research.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.550
You did karate in grade school,

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:28.660
and now you're in the student 
council, Kurogane Taito-kun.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:35.540
I'm actually interested 
in the student council.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:40.710
So could you talk to the president 
about letting me join?

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.860
Huh? Why?

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:47.380
Uh, okay. I got it. I'll talk to Gekkou.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.510
Really? Promise!

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.850
I'll be waiting for an invitation!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.380
Did you know, Hime-chan?!

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.990
This date thing is super crazy!

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:03.940
Date? What's that?

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.630
Right here!

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:16.010
A date is when a boy and a girl go out 
together to do a bunch of fun stuff!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:17.190
Opportunities for intimacy

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.320
Top 3 ranking of behavior that grabs a man's heart

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:20.120
I wonder if Taito would enjoy this.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:23.630
Hey, Hime-chan! How would you 
plan a date with immortal guy?

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:26.820
A date with Taito...?

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:29.450
Don't get too happy, Saitohimea.

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:33.420
The Seraphim are no longer pursuing 
you, but you still aren't free...

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:34.590
I know.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.370
Gekkou! Gekkou! I wanna go on a date!

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:44.120
Date! Date! Date!

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:46.440
C'mon! Let's go on a date!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.420
Shut up.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:52.540
Why should I waste my valuable time 
on a unproductive activity with you?

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.490
Date! Date!

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:58.830
I wanna go on a date! 
C'mon! Take me on a date!

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.540
A date with Taito...

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:06.040
I woke up early again today,

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:10.380
so I got all fired up 
about making lunch...

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.050
But you ended up making too much?

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.140
Uh-huh.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.720
Please have some.

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:20.640
Uh...

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:24.530
Eat it, damn it.

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.150
Don't you understand?

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.980
You have no choice in the matter.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.070
Eat it now!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.360
This very instant!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:35.690
Man, I'm starving.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.560
Thanks, Haruka!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.100
Go ahead.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:43.100
Eat. Eat. Eat.

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.710
H-How is it?

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.720
It's good.

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.130
It's really good!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.380
Yes!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.010
I'm so happy for you, Haruka.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:58.450
A new couple is born!

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.660
Taito!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:05.060
Hey, let's go on a date!

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.680
Miyasaka High School

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.080
Student Council

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.820
I have returned,

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:29.770
Lir.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.510
You have been blessed with a new master

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.880
and an entertaining student council.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:37.910
I'm sure that you're having fun.

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.720
Though since I've grown up,

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.790
you can no longer see me...

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:54.690
Geh.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:08.090
Man, is today run-into-freaks day?

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:12.920
It appears that I've embarrassed 
myself before I've even started.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:15.210
Before you've even started?

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:19.170
My name is Kurosu Firiel Yuuichi.

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:23.050
A handsome man of mixed blood who 
will be the new English teacher.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:24.320
And...

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.330
I'm also the advisor for 
the student council.

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:31.480
The student council advisor?!

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:34.980
H-Hey! Why do you suddenly 
want to go on a date?

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.690
It's so nice outside.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.660
It'd be a waste to spend 
the day at school.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.570
No, wait.

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:46.060
It's dangerous to leave the school.

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:50.720
You know, since you're only safe 
here because of the barrier...

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.500
So you're not excited...

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:58.070
You don't want to go on a date...

00:10:58.620 --> 00:10:59.260
...with me?

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:04.660
Well, Taito?

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:07.680
Th-That's not it...

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:12.060
Sorry, I have business 
to take care of today.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:17.760
I don't have the ability 
to protect Himea yet...

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:26.040
I see. I guess it can't be helped then.

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:32.000
Let's go on a date some other time then.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:50.560
Fine.

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.860
I'll deal with it.

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:56.710
Are you heading out?!

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:57.980
I'm coming with you!

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:03.000
A magic trap has been 
set inside the city?

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:16.300
Huh? Was Hime-chan crying?

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:17.420
I couldn't care less.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:20.300
When a quadratic equation has limits
Start by drawing a graph to determine the vertex

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.300
Now, in this example,

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.300
we are given the equation

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:27.920
y=(x-1)^2+1,

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:33.130
(0≤x≤3).

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:36.020
Don't give up, Haruka!! Try a five-box lunch next time! -Satomi

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.380
Everyone...

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:41.780
Thank you...

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.550
There's a trap here?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.510
Guan Yu and Zhang Fei!

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:55.640
They're adorable!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.150
Is this some kind of joke?!

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.230
Gekkou, it's 200 yen a turn!

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:05.760
I promise to catch it in 
one try, so lend me money!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.070
Okay? Pretty please?

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:07.840
Shut up.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:09.470
I'll do it.

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:11.760
Gekkou...

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.790
Guan Yu Three Kingdoms    Zhang Fei Three Kingdoms

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.940
Now!

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.120
Yay!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.360
Karate

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:41.340
Dojo

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.340
Renjaku Karate Dojo

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.010
Anyone home?!

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:47.300
If I want to become stronger, 
I'll have to fight!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.500
Uh...

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:55.140
Begin!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.500
Strike with the soul

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.200
H-He took out the national champion!

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.160
Huh?

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:21.170
H-He took out the Olympic medalist!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:25.170
H-He took out the 
current world champion!

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:28.300
Seriously?

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:35.680
Hey, hey! You're awesome, Gekkou!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:38.180
Karaoke

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:38.180
It only took you 38 tries!

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:41.150
It's the theme of the 
Five Tiger Generals!

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:41.800
Three Kingdom Daevas   Five Tiger Generals

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.070
This is a high-level spell...

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:51.910
It must be the church 
or Temperon Crowley...

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:56.320
A perfect score on this 
song will undo the spell.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.250
Show me some respect.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:02.010
There is no perfect score 
that can evade my grasp.

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:04.870
Gekkou!

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.470
Hey, hey, Gekkou! I'm awesome, yeah?

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.860
I got a perfect score on my first try!

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:21.980
Dr. Cinnamon!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.450
Gekkou! Gekkou! I want some!

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:31.550
Hey, she's cute.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:36.330
Hello, little girl.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:40.600
If you come with us, we'll treat 
you to something much better.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:41.890
Something much better?!

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:44.790
Gekkou!

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:47.460
Get your hands off my property.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.130
Who the hell are you?

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:51.800
There's gonna be a fight?! 
You're gonna fight?!

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.300
No. I'm going to take out the trash.

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.560
This might take a while.

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.950
They were all taken out by one kid?!

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:16.050
Yeah, he took out a hundred of them!

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:20.050
There are some crazy people out there.

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:23.600
Well, I'm in no position to talk.

00:16:24.020 --> 00:16:27.000
Since I'm barely human now.

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:32.290
And I still can't handle 
those guys in a fight.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.050
What am I supposed to do?

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:37.900
The way things stand, I don't have 
the ability to protect Himea...!

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:42.310
Oh, it's immortal guy!

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:46.590
It's you guys... What 
are you doing here?

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:47.690
We're on a date!

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.870
Wait, when have I ever 
gone on a date with you?

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:51.440
Right now!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.590
Nonsense! I would never...

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:54.850
So, where did you go?

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:58.150
Um, the arcade, a karaoke bar...

00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:59.530
Sounds like a date to me.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.290
You're wrong.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.960
Oh, and we took out the trash.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.270
Mirai!

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:05.240
Okay!

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:09.380
That's right. Hime-chan was crying.

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:15.800
Idiots are considered idiots because 
they keep making the same mistakes.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.970
You have no idea.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.690
Bye-bye, immortal guy!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.730
Himea...?

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.700
You don't want to go on a date...

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.260
...with me?

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:36.070
No... I want to protect Himea...

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:38.440
I have to protect her!

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:46.080
Then explain why Himea is always 
so anxious, always so afraid?

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:49.580
I want to become stronger 
for Himea's sake...

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.430
She was always alone...

00:17:55.430 --> 00:17:58.180
Sad and suffering...

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.770
I'm an idiot!

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:06.040
I swore that I would never 
let her feel lonely again!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.370
Taito's desk...

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.330
Taito...

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.670
Himea!

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:49.260
Taito...

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.060
Himea.

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:56.590
L-Let's go on a date, right now!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.060
U-Uh...

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:20.130
Uh-huh! Let's!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.770
Let's go on a date!

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:30.730
So, where are you going to take me?

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:32.210
Where...?

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:34.180
Taito?

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:37.830
Ah! You don't have anything planned!

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.720
This is supposed to be a date.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.490
S-Sorry...

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:45.030
Honestly... I don't believe this.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.180
Forget about the date.

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:53.900
Just kidding.

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:55.670
Now we're even.

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:00.900
It doesn't matter if you 
don't take me anywhere.

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:03.550
As long as I'm with you,

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.680
I'll be happy.

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:30.310
Himea   Taito

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:44.280
Hey, where's your house?

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:47.370
Uh... Around there, I guess.

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:49.450
I see...

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:51.940
It's so close...

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:56.640
I want to go visit

00:21:57.200 --> 00:21:58.580
your room...

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:03.150
I-It's too early for that!

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.580
Wait, that's not the issue here!

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:07.110
What am I saying?!

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:17.270
You know...

00:22:17.760 --> 00:22:19.770
I let myself dream a bit.

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:26.830
I thought I might be able to walk 
around freely if you were with me.

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:28.980
Himea...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:34.130
But you were worried about how 
dangerous it is out there.

00:22:34.760 --> 00:22:37.810
You helped me realize 
what I already knew.

00:22:38.060 --> 00:22:41.520
I can't leave this place...

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:47.470
The world is unkind

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:50.550
to a vampire like me...

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.470
But I'll be fine.

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:14.890
As long as you're with me...

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:29.980
You can go wherever you want!

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:36.870
I promise to become stronger!

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:42.310
Strong enough to protect you 
from whatever's out there!

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:43.850
Taito...

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:48.890
Yes.

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:51.190
I'll be waiting.

00:23:51.690 --> 00:23:52.370
Yeah.

00:23:53.670 --> 00:23:55.510
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:56.870
Yeah.

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.350
But try to make it quick.

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:06.950
Uh... I'll try my best.

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:13.650
Gekkou! Gekkou! Gekkou! 
Buy me something!

00:24:13.650 --> 00:24:15.820
Go look through a grocery ad.

00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:18.640
Gekkou! Gekkou! Gekkou! 
I wanna go to karaoke!

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.720
You're free to sing all 
you want in the shower.

00:24:20.720 --> 00:24:23.970
Gekkou! Gekkou! Gekkou! 
I want some Dr. Cinnamon!

00:24:23.970 --> 00:24:27.860
Ah, I didn't drain the 
bathtub last night.

00:24:27.860 --> 00:24:29.250
You can help yourself to that.

00:24:29.250 --> 00:24:33.250
Gekkou! Gekkou! Gekkou! 
Why are you so mean?

00:24:33.250 --> 00:24:36.700
Because I'm a genius, and you're trash.

00:24:35.140 --> 00:24:40.020
Next Time "The Pop-Quizzing New Teacher"

00:24:36.700 --> 00:24:38.620
I'm not trash!
